The structure of compound **L** is shown. R represents a hydrocarbon chain.

{{figure:pdf_visual_05.png}}

A student was asked to deduce the full structure of **L**.

The student analysed **L** using infrared spectroscopy. The following spectrum was obtained.

{{figure:pdf_visual_06.png}}

Absorption Y shows that **L** has a C=C bond present in the R group.

The student decided to treat **L** with hot concentrated acidified potassium manganate(VII). The products of the reaction are shown.

{{figure:pdf_visual_07.png}}
